<title>CROATIA: Croatia Sept PPI 0.1 pct, slows to 1.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatia Sept PPI 0.1 pct, slows to 1.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA PRODUCER PRICES   SEPTEMBER  AUGUST  JAN-SEPT  SEPT'95</p>
<p> Monthly change (pct)	  +0.1	-0.0	--	+0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year		    +1.1	+1.3     +1.4     +2.9</p>
<p>NOTES -- September producer prices were 0.4 percent lower than at the end of 1995. They rose 1.1 percent compared to last year's average. Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly producer price inflation was running at 29.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
